{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/772113-weather-manipulating-gifts","id":772113,"title":"Weather manipulating Gifts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-22T23:29:52-08:00","id":772113,"title":"Weather manipulating Gifts?","content":"Are there any canon weather manipulating Gifts? I seem to recall a Gift for just about anything except affecting the weather.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T03:00:19-08:00","id":772180,"title":"","content":"I've had a scour through rank 4-6 gifts (including planetary) and cant find anything that grants full control over the weather. <br /> <br /> But then it is a huge aspect of nature for any one garou to hold sway over.<br /> <br /> Black furies have a level 5 that allows them to summon/use a terrible hail storm.<br /> <br /> Shadow lords have a level 1 that can bring rain. Other tribes have wind, fog, and other elements of weather at their command for brief moments. But I dont see anything or know of anything that grants full control of the top of my head.<br /> <br /> Perhaps one of the other changing breeds?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T04:34:46-08:00","id":772224,"title":"","content":"From the old Bastet Breed Book:<br /> Bastet General 5: Go and &quot;Sooth/Summon Storm&quot; at your will! Takes quite long to build up though....<br /> Bastet Metis 5: Do you fear &quot;Nala's Wrath&quot;? You should, Calling the Wrath of Wyld herself upon your foes in an instant and having it take the the shape of a tempest is devastating - and faster than &quot;Summon Storm&quot;<br /> Pumonca 2: Did someone ask for a shower? &quot;Raincalling&quot; is the answer.<br /> Pumonca 6: They can call &quot;Earthquake&quot; and Gaia follows!<br /> Simba 5: They can have it being time for the &quot;Rising Sun&quot; at any time... well, not a real &quot;Weather&quot; effect, but it is REAL sunlight, and sunlight causes weather after all.... well, not thist one...<br /> <br /> Oh, and Bubasti (as well as Kitsune) can learn magic from the sorcerers... and... voila! The domain of Weather Magic is at their hands!<br /> <br /> Go on on Hengeyokai:<br /> Hakkan 5: Divine Wind. Exactly what it says on the tin.<br /> Nagah 5: Call the Flood. Exactly what it says on the tin, but worded only for rivers.<br /> Same Bito 4+5: Going to double sized &quot;Tsunami Form&quot; and then &quot;Teanoi's Rage&quot; turns a Same-Bito into something that is nothing short of an almost unstoppable force of nature...<br /> Zhong Lung 4: Anger of the Wani = Invoke the Spirits of the Storm (Wendigo)<br /> Kitsune Roko 5: Song of the Great Beast could potentially bring a lesser Dragon to help, which in turn can manipulate weather as it wants...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9729-hira-akigi","name":"Hira Akigi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"ke